Tools
- Rendering, events and reading-time checks: the Lemo-Opuscar library (core/render, core/lib.js, core/audio/sfx.py), MIT licence, https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar. Used as tooling; imported at build time, not copied into this folder.
- Headless Chromium (Playwright) for frame capture; ffmpeg for encoding and loudness normalisation.

Music and sound
- Original score and all sound effects synthesised in code for this film (synth.py, mix.py). No samples, no recordings, no third-party music.

Images
- Every image is drawn in code at render time. No photos, stock footage or generated images.

Facts (general rules of thumb, rounded)
- An arabica coffee plant first bears fruit at about 3 years; a cherry usually holds 2 seeds; sun-drying takes about 3 weeks; roasting runs at about 200 °C for roughly 10–14 minutes; about 70 beans (~7 g) make one cup.
